A '''Maggot''' is a type of monster introduced in the vanilla content of ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Rebirth]]''. They can be commonly found in [[Chapter 2]]. {{dlc|a}} They can also be found wandering about within [[Library|libraries]].

As their name suggests, they're blind, white insect maggots that lack any appendages. They crawl around the room slowly and aimlessly, but will deal damage upon full contact.

