'''Small Maggots''' are a type of Maggots added in ''[[The Binding of Isaac: Repentance]]'' DLC. They can be exclusively found in {{s|Corpse}}.

They are quite similar to regular Maggots but are variants that are very small in size. Shortly after spawning, they very slowly crawl towards Isaac. They are primarily spawned by {{e|Pustule}}s, {{e|Level 2 Horf}}s , and [[Corpse (Bosses)|Corpse's bosses]].

